{b} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4u-v \\\\ 9u+5v\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4u-v-2 \\\\ 9u+5v-3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding elements, we obtain\n\n$$\nx=4u+(-1)v-2,\\,y=9u+5v-3\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\na+b+c=-1+9+5=13.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259643 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172094 :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Parametric Representation of an Affine Transformation Given its Matrix Form"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "506f9d2d-d08a-56f9-98e6-3535609b1da4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257470} {:answer/id #uuid "76cc7d25-0d63-5fa5-9287-8cd0b7cf87ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257829} {:answer/id #uuid "bbf5d7a0-0461-5380-8b1d-7aa6631a5d16" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186258425} {:answer/id #uuid "c14197eb-d474-53b1-b351-f8738ddeafd2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186258471} {:answer/id #uuid "e94689f3-f817-50df-9027-5eb925d967a7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186258804}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e94689f3-f817-50df-9027-5eb925d967a7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186258804} :answer-field/id #uuid "ea132969-c4fb-52c6-aa2f-d42f10a0b35d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186259441}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e491209f-8e14-5a51-846e-3087f73ab2f3" :question/math-academy-id "q-124265" :question/problem "The matrix form of the affine transformation\n\n$$\nx=au+6v+b,\\,y=cu-4v\n$$\n\nis shown below. What is the value of $a+b+c?$\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 6 \\\\ 3 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "An affine transformation $T:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{2}$ is a function of the form\n\n$$\nx=Au+b,\n$$\n\nwhere $x,u,$ and $b$ are column vectors in ${R}^{2},$ and $A$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nWe can carry out the matrix operations using the matrix form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix} & =\\overbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 6 \\\\ 3 & -4\\end{bmatrix}}^{A}\\cdot \\overbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix}}^{u}+\\overbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}}^{b} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}u+6v \\\\ 3u-4v\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}u+6v \\\\ 3u-4v\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding elements, we obtain\n\n$$\nx=1u+6v+0,\\,y=3u-4v\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\na+b+c=1+0+3=4.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259644 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172094 :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Parametric Representation of an Affine Transformation Given its Matrix Form"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "13bc5571-4143-5aae-96cf-6f2be18ea704" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256958} {:answer/id #uuid "2b6e7a59-7e19-5f06-994d-4e3590c3b8bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257171} {:answer/id #uuid "c64c4347-213c-5d26-b1fc-9c4dcd0170a7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :a