e{\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}}_{A}\\cdot \\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix}}_{u}+\\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}}_{b}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\na+b+c=2+1+(-2)=1.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259655 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172093 :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Matrix Representation of an Affine Transformation Given its Parametric Form"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01350874-c575-5e87-9942-b73d549773cf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256793} {:answer/id #uuid "58d4a7a7-b300-54be-b8b9-e942e97ed67d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257553} {:answer/id #uuid "5cf8de9f-1c39-50e9-ba1a-5b22b73cacee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257590} {:answer/id #uuid "b7e5fa5c-635b-5a31-a047-dcc83173e338" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186258390} {:answer/id #uuid "f878d7d8-0d4a-5961-98f0-e1d015a28949" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186258961}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b7e5fa5c-635b-5a31-a047-dcc83173e338" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186258390} :answer-field/id #uuid "ecef4226-5d38-5b30-8307-348333368ee7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186259446}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "eb674c4e-2ce4-5235-ac2b-98b363cda424" :question/math-academy-id "q-124292" :question/problem "The matrix form of the affine transformation\n\n$$\nx=3v-8u,\\,y=3u-v\n$$\n\nis shown below. What is the value of $a+b+c?$\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}a & 3 \\\\ b & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ c\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "An affine transformation $T:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{2}$ is a function of the form\n\n$$\nx=Au+b,\n$$\n\nwhere $x,u,$ and $b$ are column vectors in ${R}^{2},$ and $A$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nFirst, notice that we can express the given transformation as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3v-8u \\\\ 3u-v\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nSeparating the constants and expressing the linear part as a product, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}3v-8u \\\\ 3u-v\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-8u+3v \\\\ 3u-v\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}}_{A}\\cdot \\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v\\end{bmatrix}}_{u}+\\underbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}}_{b}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\na+b+c=-8+3+0=-5.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259656 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172093 :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Matrix Representation of an Affine Transformation Given its Parametric Form"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "18d0da4d-3a14-594d-b8f6-132da7f61917" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256996} {:answer/id #uuid "7e2b2ff1-3ff6-5427-9954-51d3f46bf3db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257901} {:answer/id #uuid "b61b99fe-0af6-5f11-9919-86101eb8cfee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/